    {
      "id": "p0163-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In his translation notes, Toby explained that this is an indirect gameplay hint and a reference to the game development studio Onion Games. More specifically, it's a reference to what Onion Games' avatar often says in English language messages online. Toby wasn't sure if this reference would work in Japanese, however, so the translator revised Onionsan's line to say:",
        "raw": "In his translation notes, Toby explained that this is an indirect gameplay\nhint and a reference to the game development studio Onion Games. More\nspecifically, it's a reference to what Onion Games' avatar often says in English\nlanguage messages online. Toby wasn't sure if this reference would work in\nJapanese, however, so the translator revised Onionsan's line to say:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09203539,
          0.33634286,
          0.68658056,
          0.42095
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0898948,
          0.33562857,
          0.69828248,
          0.42202143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          14,
          15,
          16,
          17,
          18
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 在翻译注释里解释，这既是间接的玩法提示，也引用了游戏开发工作室 Onion Games。具体来说，Onion Games 的形象角色常在网上发布的英语消息里这么说。不过，Toby 不确定这个典故对日本玩家是否有效，所以译者把这句台词改为：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09203539,
          0.33491429,
