        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left",
        "gap_before": 12,
        "flow_after": "p0163-b004"
      },
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09203539,
          0.33491429,
          0.69624382,
          0.42452143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "review_issues": [
        "原文此处写 revised Onionsan’s line，但页首与截图均为 Papyrus 在电话中说话。译文避免重复疑似笔误，待编辑确认。"
      ]
